# Keep the build context to what `cargo build -p conduit-api` actually reads:
# Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock, rust-toolchain.toml, and crates/ (including
# conduit-store/migrations, which sqlx::migrate! embeds at compile time).
#
# Everything excluded here is also a cache key that no longer invalidates the
# image build, so editing the README or firmware YAML no longer forces a full
# recompile.
/.git
/.github
/.cargo/registry
/target
/firmware
/frontend
/scripts
/assets
*.md
**/.DS_Store
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
# Per-service developer virtualenvs. They are host-built (wrong platform for
# the image), hundreds of megabytes each, and the service Dockerfiles that
# copy a whole service directory would otherwise bake one in.
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
